From 0dc54388dd9c191cba261b5003749a0cc2c7c20a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Samuel=20Mar=C3=ADn=20Soto?= <samarin@estudiantec.cr>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 12:02:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Sanitize composite glyph point counts

Backport of the upstream composite-glyph fix as carried in UXP's
vendored snapshot: component point counts are accumulated through a
level-aware traversal and checked against the maxp limits, glyph
buffer retrieval is factored into GetGlyphBufferSection, and version-1
maxp fields are only read when maxp is actually version 1.
Corresponds to upstream commits 2aa01b66 ("Sanitise values for
maxPoints, maxComponentPoints maxComponentDepth"), 1303375a ("Factor
out glyph buffer retrieval") and 1141c81c ("[glyf] Guard access to
maxp version 1 fields").
